<view class="aed-page">
  <view class="toolbar"><button class="search" bindtap="search" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}"><text class="search-icon">⌕</text>{{busy?'正在定位 / 搜索…':'开始搜索附近 AED'}}</button><button class="filter" bindtap="chooseRadius" disabled="{{busy}}">{{radius/1000}}<text>公里 ▾</text></button></view>
  <view class="map-frame"><map wx:if="{{located}}" id="aedMap" class="map" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" scale="{{scale}}" markers="{{markers}}" circles="{{circles}}" show-location="{{true}}" enable-rotate="{{false}}" bindmarkertap="onMarker" bindcallouttap="onMarker"></map><view wx:else class="map-placeholder"><view class="location-symbol">⌖</view><view class="placeholder-title">从你的位置开始</view><view>点击上方按钮，查找附近 AED</view><text>仅在你操作时获取位置，不持续追踪</text></view></view>
  <view class="location-row"><view><view class="location-status">{{located?'● 已定位':'○ 尚未定位'}}</view><text>{{located?accuracy:'授权后显示地图及当前位置'}}</text></view><button class="recenter" bindtap="recenter" disabled="{{busy}}">⌖ 回到我的位置</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="message error">{{error}}<text bindtap="search">重新搜索 ›</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="detail-card"><view class="detail-top"><text class="aed-badge">AED</text><text class="distance">直线 {{selected.distanceText}}</text></view><view class="station-title">{{selected.name}}</view><view class="address">{{selected.address}}</view><view class="route-grid"><view><text>预计步行</text><view>{{walking}}</view></view><view><text>预计驾车</text><view>{{driving}}</view></view></view><button class="navigate" bindtap="navigate">导航前往 <text>↗</text></button><view class="detail-note">路线时间仅供参考 · 导航将在微信地图中打开</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{searched}}" class="results"><view class="results-head">附近 AED <text>{{stations.length}} 个搜索结果</text></view><view wx:if="{{!stations.length}}" class="empty">本次未找到 AED 点位<text>不代表附近没有设备，可扩大范围或询问现场工作人员。</text></view><view wx:for="{{stations}}" wx:key="uid" class="result-row {{selected.uid===item.uid?'active':''}}" data-uid="{{item.uid}}" bindtap="onStation"><view class="result-number">{{index+1}}</view><view class="result-info"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>{{item.address}}</text></view><text class="result-distance">{{item.distanceText}} ›</text></view><view wx:if="{{limited}}" class="limit-note">仅展示本次检索返回的部分点位，并非完整设备清单。</view></view>
  <view class="source-note">点位与路线信息来源：百度地图<br/>设备是否可用、具体楼层与开放时间尚未核验，请以现场为准。紧急情况请优先拨打 120。</view>
</view>
